  "pages": {
    "index.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "בית ספר לכדורגל בבאר שבע | גולאסו – אימונים וימי הולדת",
        "meta_descr": "גולאסו – בית ספר לכדורגל לילדים בבאר שבע, לכיתות א'-ו'. ימי הולדת כדורגל, אימונים אישיים, ימי גיבוש ומחנה קיץ. השאירו פרטים או שלחו וואטסאפ.",
        "header_custom": "<!-- seo -->\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://gollasso.com/\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"he_IL\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"גולאסו\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://gollasso.com/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"בית ספר לכדורגל בבאר שבע | גולאסו – אימונים וימי הולדת\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"גולאסו – בית ספר לכדורגל לילדים בבאר שבע, לכיתות א&#x27;-ו&#x27;. ימי הולדת כדורגל, אימונים אישיים, ימי גיבוש ומחנה קיץ. השאירו פרטים או שלחו וואטסאפ.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://gollasso.com/assets/images/og-golazo.jpg\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [{\"@type\": \"SportsOrganization\", \"@id\": \"https://gollasso.com/#org\", \"name\": \"גולאסו\", \"alternateName\": \"Golazo\", \"url\": \"https://gollasso.com/\", \"logo\": \"https://gollasso.com/assets/images/logo-golazo.png\", \"image\": \"https://gollasso.com/assets/images/og-golazo.jpg\", \"description\": \"בית ספר לכדורגל לילדים בבאר שבע: אימוני כדורגל, ימי הולדת כדורגל, אימונים אישיים, ימי גיבוש ומחנה קיץ.\", \"sport\": \"Soccer\", \"telephone\": \"+972-54-773-3821\", \"email\": \"Mani281279@gmail.com\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"באר שבע\", \"addressRegion\": \"מחוז הדרום\", \"addressCountry\": \"IL\"}, \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"City\", \"name\": \"באר שבע\"}, \"sameAs\": [\"https://www.facebook.com/p/%D7%92%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%90%D7%A1%D7%95-%D7%94%D7%A4%D7%A2%D7%9C%D7%95%D7%AA-%D7%A1%D7%A4%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%98-%D7%95%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%A0%D7%99-%D7%9B%D7%93%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%92%D7%9C-100063978907753/\", \"https://www.instagram.com/golasso_b7/\"]}, {\"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"@id\": \"https://gollasso.com/#site\", \"url\": \"https://gollasso.com/\", \"name\": \"גולאסו\", \"inLanguage\": \"he\"}, {\"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"לאילו גילאים מתאים בית הספר לכדורגל?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"בית הספר לכדורגל של גולאסו מיועד לילדים בכיתות א'-ו'. האימונים משלבים לימוד יסודות המשחק, ציוד חדיש ומשחקים מול קבוצות מתחרות.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"מה כולל יום הולדת כדורגל בגולאסו?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"הפעלת כדורגל או ספורט עם מאמן מקצועי, ציוד חדיש לכל ילד וילדה, החוגג מקבל את הכבוד של קפטן הקבוצה, מוזיקה והגברה, פרסים והפתעות, גביע לחוגג ומדליות לכל הילדים. הפעילות נמשכת כ-90 דקות.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"האם הפעילויות מתאימות גם לבנות?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"כן. ימי ההולדת, הפעלות הספורט וימי הגיבוש מתאימים לבנים ולבנות.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"מה עובדים עליו באימון אישי?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"קואורדינציה, שליטה בכדור, שדרוג יסודות המשחק, ראייה מרחבית והעצמת הילד. האימונים מותאמים לילד ומלווים תהליכים ארוכים.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"מה זה יום גיבוש והפעלת ספורט?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"פעילות חברתית וספורטיבית לקבוצות ילדים: משחקי צוות, תחרויות ומשחקי כדורגל עם ציוד ייחודי. מתאים לכיתות, לקבוצות ולמסיבות סיום.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"איך נרשמים או מזמינים פעילות?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"משאירים פרטים בטופס שבתחתית העמוד, שולחים הודעת וואטסאפ או מתקשרים ל-054-773-3821, ונחזור אליכם עם כל הפרטים.\"}}]}]}</script>",
        "footer_custom": "",
        "html_before": "",
        "meta_image": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/og-golazo.jpg",
        "main": true
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "_name": "go-nav",
          "_sourceTheme": "gumm5",
          "_styles": {
            "position": "sticky",
            "top": "0",
            "z-index": "1030",
            "direction": "rtl",
            "padding": "0",
            "background": "rgba(1, 24, 78, .9)",
            "-webkit-backdrop-filter": "saturate(160%) blur(14px)",
            "backdrop-filter": "saturate(160%) blur(14px)",
            "border-bottom": "1px solid rgba(111, 208, 255, .18)",
            ".go-toggle": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "opacity": "0",
              "pointer-events": "none",
              "width": "1px",
              "height": "1px"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".go-toggle": {
                "display": "none"
              }
            },
            ".go-bar": {
              "max-width": "1320px",
              "margin": "0 auto",
              "height": "82px",
              "padding": "0 clamp(16px, 3vw, 40px)",
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "gap": "18px"
            },
            ".go-logo": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "12px",
              "flex": "none",
              "text-decoration": "none !important"
            },
            ".go-logo img": {
              "height": "60px",
              "width": "auto",
              "display": "block",
              "border-radius": "0",
              "filter": "drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35))",
              "transition": "transform .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)"
            },
            ".go-logo:hover img": {
              "transform": "rotate(-8deg) scale(1.06)"
            },
            ".go-logo-name": {
              "font-family": "'Karantina', sans-serif",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "font-size": "2.1rem",
              "line-height": "1",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".go-links": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "2px",
              "list-style": "none",
              "margin": "0",
              "padding": "0"
            },
            ".go-links li": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".go-link": {
              "display": "block",
              "padding": "9px 13px",
              "border-radius": "999px",
              "color": "#ffffff !important",
              "font-weight": "500",
              "font-size": "1rem",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "transition": "background .25s, color .25s"
            },
            ".go-link:hover, .go-link:focus-visible": {
              "background": "rgba(111, 208, 255, .16)",
              "color": "#6fd0ff !important"
            },
            ".go-has-sub > .go-link::after": {
              "content": "''",
              "display": "inline-block",
              "width": "6px",
              "height": "6px",
              "margin-right": "8px",
              "border-left": "2px solid currentColor",
              "border-bottom": "2px solid currentColor",
              "transform": "translateY(-3px) rotate(-45deg)"
            },
            ".go-sub": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "calc(100% + 10px)",
              "right": "0",
              "min-width": "250px",
              "list-style": "none",
              "margin": "0",
              "padding": "10px",
              "background": "#ffffff",
              "border-radius": "20px",
              "box-shadow": "0 30px 60px -28px rgba(1, 24, 78, .6)",
              "opacity": "0",
              "visibility": "hidden",
              "transform": "translateY(8px)",
              "transition": "opacity .25s, transform .25s, visibility .25s"
            },
            ".go-sub::before": {
              "content": "''",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "-12px",
              "right": "0",
              "left": "0",
              "height": "12px"
            },
            ".go-has-sub:hover .go-sub, .go-has-sub:focus-within .go-sub": {
              "opacity": "1",
              "visibility": "visible",
              "transform": "none"
            },
            ".go-sublink": {
              "display": "block",
              "padding": "10px 14px",
              "border-radius": "12px",
              "color": "#01184e !important",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "font-size": ".98rem",
              "font-weight": "500"
            },
            ".go-sublink:hover": {
              "background": "#eef4fd",
              "color": "#0a58c9 !important"
            },
            ".go-suball": {
              "margin-top": "4px",
              "border-top": "1px solid #e3ebf7",
              "border-radius": "0 0 12px 12px",
              "color": "#0a58c9 !important"
            },
            ".go-actions": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "10px",
              "flex": "none"
            },
            ".go-phone": {
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "9px",
              "color": "#ffffff !important",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "font-weight": "500"
            },
            ".go-phone i": {
              "width": "42px",
              "height": "42px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "display": "inline-grid",
              "place-items": "center",
              "background": "rgba(111, 208, 255, .16)",
              "color": "#6fd0ff"
            },
            ".go-phone svg": {
              "width": "19px",
              "height": "19px"
            },
            ".go-cta": {
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding": "12px 22px",
              "border-radius": "999px",
              "color": "#01184e !important",
              "font-weight": "600",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "background": "linear-gradient(120deg, #23dcfc, #6fd0ff)",
              "white-space": "nowrap",
              "transition": "transform .25s"
            },
            ".go-cta:hover": {
              "transform": "translateY(-2px)"
            },
            ".go-burger": {
              "display": "none",
              "width": "48px",
              "height": "48px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "margin": "0",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "background": "rgba(111, 208, 255, .16)",
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".go-burger span": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "right": "14px",
              "left": "14px",
              "height": "2px",
              "border-radius": "2px",
              "background": "#ffffff",
              "transition": "transform .3s, opacity .3s, top .3s"
            },
            ".go-burger span:nth-child(1)": {
              "top": "17px"
            },
            ".go-burger span:nth-child(2)": {
              "top": "23px"
            },
            ".go-burger span:nth-child(3)": {
              "top": "29px"
            },
            ".go-toggle:checked ~ .go-bar .go-burger span:nth-child(1)": {
              "top": "23px",
              "transform": "rotate(45deg)"
            },
            ".go-toggle:checked ~ .go-bar .go-burger span:nth-child(2)": {
              "opacity": "0"
            },
            ".go-toggle:checked ~ .go-bar .go-burger span:nth-child(3)": {
              "top": "23px",
              "transform": "rotate(-45deg)"
            },
            ".go-toggle:focus-visible ~ .go-bar .go-burger": {
              "outline": "3px solid #23dcfc",
              "outline-offset": "2px"
            },
            ".go-panel": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 1180px)": {
              ".go-phone-num": {
                "display": "none"
              },
              ".go-link": {
                "padding": "9px 10px"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".go-menu": {
                "display": "none"
              },
              ".go-burger": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".go-bar": {
                "height": "70px"
              },
              ".go-logo img": {
                "height": "50px"
              },
              ".go-logo-name": {
                "font-size": "1.8rem"
              },
              ".go-actions .go-cta": {
                "display": "none"
              },
              ".go-panel": {
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-direction": "column",
                "justify-content": "space-between",
                "gap": "24px",
                "position": "fixed",
                "top": "70px",
                "right": "0",
                "left": "0",
                "height": "calc(100vh - 70px)",
                "overflow-y": "auto",
                "padding": "18px 22px 30px",
                "background": "#01184e",
                "background-image": "radial-gradient(600px 400px at 100% 0%, rgba(42, 168, 255, .25), transparent 70%)",
                "opacity": "0",
                "visibility": "hidden",
                "transform": "translateY(-12px)",
                "transition": "opacity .3s, transform .3s, visibility .3s"
              },
              ".go-toggle:checked ~ .go-panel": {
                "opacity": "1",
                "visibility": "visible",
                "transform": "none"
              },
              ".go-plinks": {
                "list-style": "none",
                "margin": "0",
                "padding": "0"
              },
              ".go-plinks > li": {
                "border-bottom": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .1)"
              },
              ".go-plinks .go-link": {
                "padding": "15px 4px",
                "border-radius": "0",
                "font-family": "'Karantina', sans-serif",
                "font-size": "2rem",
                "font-weight": "700",
                "line-height": "1"
              },
              ".go-plinks .go-has-sub > .go-link::after": {
                "display": "none"
              },
              ".go-plinks .go-sub": {
                "position": "static",
                "opacity": "1",
                "visibility": "visible",
                "transform": "none",
                "box-shadow": "none",
                "background": "transparent",
                "padding": "0 0 12px",
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "gap": "8px",
                "min-width": "0"
              },
              ".go-plinks .go-sub li": {
                "list-style": "none"
              },
              ".go-plinks .go-sublink": {
                "padding": "9px 14px",
                "border": "1px solid rgba(111, 208, 255, .35)",
                "border-radius": "999px",
                "color": "#ffffff !important",
                "font-size": ".95rem"
              },
              ".go-plinks .go-suball": {
                "border-top": "1px solid rgba(111, 208, 255, .35)",
                "border-radius": "999px",
                "color": "#6fd0ff !important",
                "margin-top": "0"
              },
              ".go-pfoot": {
                "display": "grid",
                "gap": "12px"
              },
              ".go-pfoot .go-cta": {
                "justify-content": "center",
                "padding": "15px 22px",
                "font-size": "1.1rem"
              },
              ".go-pphone": {
                "color": "#ffffff !important",
                "text-align": "center",
                "font-size": "1.15rem",
                "text-decoration": "none !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"go-nav\" group=\"Custom\" global once=\"menu\" always-top not-draggable>\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Colors</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Accent\" name=\"accentColor\" value=\"#23dcfc\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"goNavToggle\" class=\"go-toggle\" aria-label=\"פתיחת התפריט\">\n  <div class=\"go-bar\">\n    <a class=\"go-logo\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"גולאסו, דף הבית\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-golazo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\" height=\"520\"><span class=\"go-logo-name\" aria-hidden=\"true\">גולאסו</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"go-menu\" aria-label=\"תפריט ראשי\"><ul class=\"go-links\"><li class=\"go-has-sub\"><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"services.html\" mbr-text>השירותים שלנו</a><ul class=\"go-sub\"><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#football-school\" mbr-text>בית הספר לכדורגל</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#birthday\" mbr-text>ימי הולדת כדורגל</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#private-training\" mbr-text>אימונים אישיים</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#team-days\" mbr-text>ימי גיבוש והפעלות ספורט</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#summer-camp\" mbr-text>מחנה קיץ</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink go-suball\" href=\"services.html\" mbr-text>כל השירותים</a></li></ul></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#why\" mbr-text>למה אצלנו</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#reviews\" mbr-text>הורים ממליצים</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#gallery\" mbr-text>גלריה</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#faq\" mbr-text>שאלות נפוצות</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#contact\" mbr-text>צרו קשר</a></li></ul></nav>\n    <div class=\"go-actions\">\n      <a class=\"go-phone\" href=\"tel:+972547733821\" aria-label=\"054-773-3821 התקשרו\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z\"/></svg></i><span class=\"go-phone-num\" dir=\"ltr\">054-773-3821</span></a>\n      <a class=\"go-cta\" href=\"index.html#contact\" mbr-text>לפרטים והרשמה</a>\n      <label for=\"goNavToggle\" class=\"go-burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"go-panel\">\n    <ul class=\"go-plinks\"><li class=\"go-has-sub\"><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"services.html\" mbr-text>השירותים שלנו</a><ul class=\"go-sub\"><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#football-school\" mbr-text>בית הספר לכדורגל</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#birthday\" mbr-text>ימי הולדת כדורגל</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#private-training\" mbr-text>אימונים אישיים</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#team-days\" mbr-text>ימי גיבוש והפעלות ספורט</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink\" href=\"services.html#summer-camp\" mbr-text>מחנה קיץ</a></li><li><a class=\"go-sublink go-suball\" href=\"services.html\" mbr-text>כל השירותים</a></li></ul></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#why\" mbr-text>למה אצלנו</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#reviews\" mbr-text>הורים ממליצים</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#gallery\" mbr-text>גלריה</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#faq\" mbr-text>שאלות נפוצות</a></li><li><a class=\"go-link\" href=\"index.html#contact\" mbr-text>צרו קשר</a></li></ul>\n    <div class=\"go-pfoot\"><a class=\"go-cta\" href=\"index.html#contact\">לפרטים והרשמה</a><a class=\"go-pphone\" href=\"tel:+972547733821\" dir=\"ltr\">054-773-3821</a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "go-nav-1",
